  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use lljson.encode</span></p>
      <p>  <p>This function takes a list and returns a <a href="http://json.org" target="_blank">JSON</a> string of that list as either a json object or json array.</p>
  <p>Returns a string that is either <b>values</b> serialized as a JSON <b>type</b>, or if an error was encountered <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/JSON_INVALID" target="_blank">JSON_INVALID</a>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>JsonType / type</td>
          <td>Type is JSON_ARRAY or JSON_OBJECT.</td>
        </tr>
